<title>LEBANON: Solidere shares mixed in Beirut.</title>
<headline>Solidere shares mixed in Beirut.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares were mixed on the Beirut Stock Exchange on Thursday as A shares slightly fell to $108.375 from Tuesday's $108.5 and B shares held steady at $114.</p>
<p>Financial markets were closed on Wednesday for the Christmas holiday.</p>
<p>Turnover in Solidere shares rose to 5,408 shares from 3,653 on Tuesday and value was $598,840.75 from $405,671.</p>
<p>There was no trade in the shares of the four other listed companies: Ciments Libanais, Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index fell 0.02 percent to 81.28 and the BLOM stock index also fell 0.04 percent to 932.48.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
</text>
